1
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,720
Are we almost there? I'm getting hungry.

2
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:12,400
Should be close. Let me check the GPS.

3
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:16,080
Uh oh. It's not working. Screen is black.

4
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:19,500
What? No way! Try restarting it quickly.

5
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,920
Still nothing. Looks like it totally crashed.

6
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:26,600
Great. We're lost in the middle of nowhere.

7
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,240
Is there a signal to use my phone map?

8
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:51,400
Nope. Dead zone. No bars anywhere.

9
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:54,820
This is just great. We're totally stranded.

10
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:58,500
Don't fret. We'll find a gas station soon.

11
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:02,440
I hope so. My bladder is about to burst.

12
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:06,380
Look! Up ahead! Is that a gas station sign?

13
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,720
Yes! Thank goodness. Pull over, pull over!

14
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:34,400
Finally! I'm going to ask for directions inside.

15
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:38,080
And grab us some snacks, please. I'm starving.

16
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:41,760
Got it. Be right back with good news.

17
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:45,440
Don't forget a map if they have one.

18
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:48,860
Will do. Phew, what a relief though.

19
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:54,980
Okay, good news! We're not too far off.

20
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:58,660
Really? Thank god! How do we get there?

21
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:02,340
Just a few more turns, then straight ahead.

22
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:05,760
Awesome! And did you get the snacks?

23
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:09,440
Loaded up on chips and sodas for us.

24
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:12,860
You're a lifesaver! Let's hit the road!

